This crate ports the PP-DocLayoutV3 inference and postprocessing from
xulihang/PP_DocLayout_ONNX (https://github.com/xulihang/PP_DocLayout_ONNX),
which is distributed without a license file at the time of porting. The
model weights (PP-DocLayoutV3.onnx) are from Bei0001/PP-DocLayoutV3-ONNX
on Hugging Face and are not included in this repository.
